 topic=("Rain, floods and mosquito control in Beaumont",
        "<p>Beaumont's heavy rains and flat terrain mean standing water after nearly every storm, and mosquitoes can hatch within days. The Jefferson County Mosquito Control District treats public areas, including by air, but yards matter too: empty containers, clear ditches and gutters, and fill low spots where water pools. Homes near bayous benefit from regular yard treatments during the warm season. See <a href=\"/services/mosquito-control/\">mosquito control</a> and <a href=\"/services/termite-control/\">termite control</a>.</p>"),
